<p>Jab Ran Ko Chalay Khaimay Se Abbas e Delawar&nbsp;<br> Sab Bibiyan Lipti The Sambhaly Howy Chader<br> Hathon Se Kamar Tham Ke Pas Aye Jo Sarwar&nbsp;<br> Bosa Leya Abbas Ke Shanon Ka Yay Keh kar<br> Tum Jesa Barader Main Kahan Paonga Bhai&nbsp;<br> Tum loat Kay Na Aye Tu Mar Jaonga Bhai</p> 
<p>Senay Se Laga Kar Shah Ne Kaha Abbas Na Jao Ruk Jao Aye Bhai Na Jao Ruk Jao</p> 
<p>Koi Bhe Nahi Hai Ab Mera Abbas Na Jao Ruk Jao Aye Bhai Na Jao Ruk Jao</p> 
<p>1) Bolo To Sakina Ko Main Samjha Dnga Abbas&nbsp;<br> Mashkiza Mujhe Dedo Main Louta Donga Abbas&nbsp;<br> Shikwa Na Karyge Pani Ka&nbsp;<br> Rakh Degi Wo Hathon Se Koza&nbsp;<br> Wo Kehna Nahi Talyge Mera&nbsp;<br> Abbas Na Jao Ruk Jao</p> 
<p>2) Thehro Ke Tmhain Dylon Main Jeny Ke Duain&nbsp;<br> Tm Mar Gaye To Kon Bachayega Ridain&nbsp;<br> Dharas Hai Tmhe Se Zainab Ko&nbsp;<br> Ja Ja Kay Batati Hai Sab Ko<br> Zinda Hai Abhe Ghazi Mera&nbsp;<br> Abbas Na Jao Ruk Jao</p> 
<p>3) Maidan Main Kis Tarha Tmhain Jane Do Bolo&nbsp;<br> Akbar Ke Tarha Pala Hai Is Bhai Ne Tum ko&nbsp;<br> Jo Ran Ko Gaya Wo Na Aya&nbsp;<br> Tum Bhe Na Agar Aye Bhaiya&nbsp;<br> Main Kesy Uthaonga Lasha&nbsp;<br> Abbas Na Jao Ruk Jao</p> 
<p>4) Ruktay He Na Thay Zainab o Kulsoom Kay Anson<br> Jab Shah Ne Kaha Choom Ke Abbas Ke Bazo&nbsp;<br> Yay Shanain Qalam Na Hojain&nbsp;<br> Be Asra Hum Na Hojain&nbsp;<br> Yay Bazo Sahara Hai Sab Ka&nbsp;<br> Abbas Na Jao Ruk Jao</p> 
<p>5) Wo Kofa Wo Zarbat Main Kahan Bhola Hon Abbas&nbsp;<br> Tum Akhri Baba Ke Nishani Ho Mery Pas&nbsp;<br> Yaad Ati Hai Jab Bhe Baba Ke&nbsp;<br> Main Dekhta Hon Tum Ko Ghazi<br> Zakhmi Na Ho Baba Ka Chehra&nbsp;<br> Abbas Na Jao Ruk Jao</p> 
<p>6) Behain Na Mery Sath Agar Hoti Alamdar&nbsp;<br> Khud Tum Ko Larai Kay Leyay Karta Main Tayar&nbsp;<br> Yan War Karogy Tum Jitne<br> Har War Ka Teri Behnon Se&nbsp;<br> Bazaar Main Lain Gay Wo Badla&nbsp;<br> Abbas Na Jao Ruk Jao</p> 
<p>7) Zeeshan o Raza Kesa Tha Ghurbat Ka Wo Manzar&nbsp;<br> Bhai Kay Qadam Chom Kay Mashkiza Utha Kar<br> Abbas Jo Niklay Khaimon Se&nbsp;<br> Girti The Ridain Khud Sar Se&nbsp;<br> Aur Kehty Rahy Shah e Wala&nbsp;<br> Abbas Na Jao Ruk Jao</p>